<Article title="Contact" description="Contact Embedded Engineering Toolkit about calculator feedback, corrections, privacy, or site accessibility." eyebrow="Contact"><h2>Technical feedback</h2><p>For a correction or feature request, describe the calculator, input values, expected result, and the documentation or standard behind the expectation. Clear reproduction details make review faster.</p><h2>Email</h2><p><a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`}>{siteConfig.email}</a></p><p>This address is a centrally managed placeholder until the site owner configures a production mailbox. Do not send confidential designs, credentials, export-controlled material, or personal data.</p><h2>Response scope</h2><p>The site cannot provide project certification, safety approval, device-specific consulting, or emergency support. General feedback may inform future revisions, but submission does not create a professional-services relationship.</p></Article>
